  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Vintage Canvas Tech Bag offers a rugged and functional solution for carrying your tablet and essential tech gear. Crafted from durable vintage canvas, this bag is designed to withstand daily wear and tear while providing high-capacity protection for your electronic devices. Featuring a padded interior, the bag ensures that your tablet and other gadgets stay safe and secure during all-day carry.</p>",
